</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Help me the slow of heart to move</l><l>By some clear, winning word of love;</l><l>Teach me the wayward feet to stay,</l><l>And guide them in the Godward way.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Teach me Thy patience; still with Thee</l><l>In closer, dearer company,</l><l>In work that keeps faith sweet and strong,</l><l>In trust that triumphs over wrong.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>In hope that sends a shining ray</l><l>Far down the future’s broad’ning way,</l><l>In peace that only Thou canst give,</l><l>With Thee, O Master, let me live.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
